{"labels": {"Can you confirm what exactly happens after you log in? For example, does the screen stay blank, does it show a loading spinner, or does it display an error message?": 0, "Clear your browser's cache and cookies, then try again": 1, "Connecting you to a human agent now.": 2, "First of you have to add part to cart and you can do it from any part detail page or part list page. Now go to cart page and then click on 'process to checkout'. On next page You will be asked for selection of Shipping address and after that you will see shipping option page at there you have to select ship option and once you continue from Ship option page you will reach at last Finalize order, Now here you have to click on Order Now button for place your order.": 3, "Go to your Cart or Shopping Bag": 4, "Have there been any recent changes to your account, such as a subscription update, profile change, or payment issue?": 5, "Have you tried refreshing the page or clearing your browser cache?": 6, "Have you tried resetting your password using the \u2018Forgot Password\u2019 option?": 7, "I am happy to help you, Let me know where you stuck so I can assist you for it": 8, "I will transfer this information to our inventory management team they will check for this part and update you.": 9, "I'll connect you to our customer service.": 10, "I'm really sorry you faced that, May I help you complete your order now?": 11, "If you are now clear can you place an order?": 12, "Make sure your device is connected to the internet": 13, "No worries. Now can you place an order for that item?": 14, "Please give me your cart number I will forward it to Our Technical team for further investigation and we will contact you soon again.": 15, "Please give me your order number I will forward it to Our Technical team for further investigation and we will contact you soon again.": 16, "Please provide us part number and make for further investigation": 17, "Please provide us part number, make for further investigation": 18, "Sure, I can help you cancel your order.": 19, "Thank you for your response. Goodbye!": 20, "Thank you for your responses. Goodbye!": 21, "Thanks for letting us know \u2014 sometimes that happens if the code has expired or has specific conditions. Would you mind sharing which code you tried?": 22, "Thanks for sharing promo code. Our Sales team will help you with promo code issues. You will shortly receive call/email from our sales team.": 23, "Thanks for sharing. Sometimes items are listed under slightly different names or out of stock. Could you share the model or part number?": 24, "That\u2019s a valid concern. Shipping and taxes are shown during checkout after confirming your zip code. So you can proceed to checkout and after selecting shipping package and location you will get final details before placing an order.": 25, "These are the delivery options available.": 26, "These are the payment methods we accept.": 27, "To unlock your account sooner or if you\u2019re unsure of your login credentials, please use the \u201cForgot Password\u201d option": 28, "To unlock your account sooner or if you\u2019re unsure of your login credentials, please use the \u201cForgot Password\u201d option.": 29, "Totally understandable, it can be confusing. That item is sold in packs of 10, so selecting 1 means you're getting a full case of 10 units.": 30, "Try resetting your password to ensure that your credentials are correctly set. This can often fix the issue if the system is confused about your login details": 31, "User Confirmation": 32, "Yes Of Course, Please let me know your problem": 33, "are you saw any error message in popup dialog during order place then please give me": 34, "can you please let me know what error are you facing": 35}, "maxlen": 22}